[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "King's Pawn Game"]
[Variation "King's Pawn Game: Wayward Queen Attack, 5.Qb3 Nd4"]
[ECO "C20"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,fork,early-queen"]
[Themes "tempo-on-queen,f7-defence"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Qh5 Nc6 3. Bc4 g6 4. Qf3 Nf6 5. Qb3"]
[Kind "for-us"]

1. e4 e5 2. Qh5 Nc6 3. Bc4 g6 4. Qf3 Nf6
5. Qb3? { Queen and bishop aim at f7 again and b7 is attacked too, so it looks strong. } 5... Nd4! { Attacks the queen and threatens ...Nxc2+, forking king and rook. If the queen retreats, the bishop on c4 can be taken. }
6. Bxf7+ Ke7 7. Qc4 b5 { Attacks the queen again, so the bishop on f7 cannot be saved. } 8. Qd3 Kxf7 *
